    "Stable build02 failed both AV admission methods before decoding. Diagnostic build03 identifies Model(Capacity): the service still configured only one Core port. The selected-program capacity and audio-only subscription/gate restrictions were corrected in the service. No source-clock race was established as this failure cause; upstream sources were unchanged.",
